        "text": "$5$ presses of $+100$ and $3$ presses of $+10$ make exactly $530$."
      },
      {
        "id": "2",
        "text": "$4$ presses of $+100$, $12$ presses of $+10$, and $10$ presses of $+1$ also make $530$, because regrouping powers of ten still totals $530$."
